  "translation": "Na long hap, wantaim ⟨את⟩ mipela, i stap wanpela yangpela man Ibrim, wokman bilong bikman bilong ol man bilong katim mit; na mipela i stori long em, na em i opim mining bilong ⟨את⟩ ol drim bilong mipela; wanwan man olsem drim bilong en, em i opim mining.",
